</div></section>

<section id="about"><div class="wrap"><div class="kicker">01 — About</div><h2 class="title">A personal brand built around purpose.</h2><p class="intro">A professional snapshot of my academic journey, leadership experience, content work, training and public communication.</p>
<div class="grid2"><div class="card"><h3>Who I am</h3><p>I’m Vamshi NM, an MBA student at SJCIT College, Chikkaballapur, Karnataka. I’m interested in communication, leadership, content creation, public speaking and practical learning.</p><div class="stats"><div class="stat"><b>8K+</b><span>Instagram community</span></div><div class="stat"><b>2.5M+</b><span>Recent views</span></div><div class="stat"><b>1M+</b><span>Peak reel reach</span></div></div></div>
<div class="card"><h3>Leadership</h3><p>I serve as <b style="color:#fff">President of the MBA Student Council at SJCIT College, Chikkaballapur</b>, contributing to student activities, coordination, communication and leadership initiatives.</p><br><p>My approach: learn continuously, communicate clearly, create consistently and turn ideas into action.</p></div></div></div></section>

<section id="work"><div class="wrap"><div class="kicker">02 — What I Do</div><h2 class="title">Work, skills & experience.</h2><p class="intro">Areas where I create, communicate, coordinate and contribute.</p>
<div class="roles">
<div class="role"><h3>🎥 Content Creation</h3><p>Educational and current-affairs storytelling in Kannada, including science, mysteries, technology and social topics.</p></div>
