<div class="role"><h3>🧑‍🏫 Training & Communication</h3><p>Content communication training, learning material development and communication-focused training activities.</p></div>
<div class="role"><h3>👑 Student Leadership</h3><p>President of the MBA Student Council at SJCIT College, Chikkaballapur, supporting student coordination and events.</p></div>
<div class="role"><h3>📚 MBA & Management</h3><p>Developing knowledge across management, marketing, communication, finance, statistics, strategy and entrepreneurship.</p></div>
<div class="role"><h3>🎯 Event Coordination</h3><p>Experience coordinating student initiatives, college activities, events and professional outreach.</p></div>
</div></div></section>

<section id="journey"><div class="wrap"><div class="kicker">03 — Journey</div><h2 class="title">Milestones that shaped the journey.</h2><div class="card timeline">
<div class="item"><div class="year">MBA</div><div><h3>Management & Leadership</h3><p>MBA journey at SJCIT College, Chikkaballapur with active involvement in student leadership and college initiatives.</p></div></div>
